"Use memory write/forget with one fact of at most 1,000 characters, scope agent or user, and tier profile or log. Forget requires exact recorded text, the same scope, and no tier." = "Usa memory write/forget con un hecho de hasta 1.000 caracteres, scope agent o user y tier profile o log. Para olvidar, indica el texto exacto y el mismo scope, sin tier.";
"Use memory write/forget with one fact of at most 1,000 characters, scope agent, and tier profile or log. Forget requires exact recorded text and no tier." = "Usa memory write/forget con un hecho de hasta 1.000 caracteres, scope agent y tier profile o log. Para olvidar, indica el texto exacto guardado sin tier.";
"This memory changed or no longer exists. Refresh the memories and request approval again." = "Este recuerdo ha cambiado o ya no existe. Actualiza los recuerdos y vuelve a solicitar aprobación.";
"This fact is already saved for this agent." = "Este hecho ya está guardado para este agente.";
